{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03F620","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"敌人明知道我们的基地位置还攻了过来。也就是说，现在再隐藏已经没有意义了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"事到如今只能战斗。选择装备时，比起伪装率，要优先考虑防御力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"可能会变成长时间战斗，所以<R=口粮,RATION>也不能少。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=口粮,RATION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过，比起必须一路攻进基地的敌人，防守的一方更有优势。没必要慌。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对方也不可能永远躲在掩体后面。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"如果能趁他们露面时用狙击步枪射击，应该能比较安全地作战。当然，也要看狙击位置。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"在他们的移动路线上设置地雷或C4也很有效。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我其实不太喜欢这种打法……但为了保护同伴，也没办法。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""}]}